。","link_td_id":"Q10009038","link_td_number_id":505348,"people_name":"子之","people_name_jianti_auto":"子之","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"8c6379e4-db0e-11ef-8e44-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-314,"link_td_description":"燕王子之，战国时曾任燕王哙的国相，后获禅让成为燕王。在位第三年时国内动荡，齐国军队趁虚而入发兵攻燕，子之被杀并剁成肉酱。","link_td_id":"Q10009038","link_td_number_id":505348,"people_name":"子之","people_name_jianti_auto":"子之","start_index":143,"tongjian_id":"8c6379ea-db0e-11ef-841a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/燕非强国","excerpts":[{"context_after":"，后赖五国之力，乐毅为将，然后胜齐，然卒于得七十城不能守...","context_before":"...春秋时最为僻小，能自见于中国者，不过三四，大率制命于齐。","source_end_index":40,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"736aac77-1802-441e-9402-8cea82e51826","source_start_index":31,"source_text":"七雄之际，为齐所取"}],"path":"四笔/卷三/燕非强国","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/序","excerpts":[{"context_after":"燕昭王以乐毅为将，合秦、赵、韩、魏之师，而后能雪耻于齐。...","context_before":"...犹且纳女归赂于齐，诚畏之也。战国时，齐、燕有不两立之势。","source_end_index":594,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"dafc8a02-71dc-5f44-b839-5f297d454005","source_start_index":572,"source_text":"子哙之乱，齐宣以五都之兵伐之，五旬而遂举燕。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/序","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"3燕子之爲王三年，國內大亂。將軍市被與太子平謀攻子之。齊王令人謂太子曰：「寡人聞太子將飭君臣之義，明父子之位，寡人之國唯太子所以令之。」太子因要黨聚衆，使市被攻子之，不克。市被反攻太子。搆難數月，死者數萬人，百姓恫恐。齊王令章子將五都之兵，因北地之衆以伐燕。燕士卒不戰，城門不閉。齊人取子之，醢之，遂殺燕王噲。","content_fanyi":"子之在燕国为王三年，国内大乱。将军市被与太子姬平谋划攻打子之。齐王派人对燕太子说：“我听说太子将要整饬君臣大义、彰明父子名位，我齐国愿意听从您的命令。”燕太子于是邀集党羽、聚合部众，派市被攻打子之，没有攻克。市被反过来攻打太子。祸乱持续数月，死亡数万人，百姓惶恐不安。齐王命令章子率领五都的军队，并借助北方地区的兵众讨伐燕国。燕国士兵不肯交战，城门也不关闭。齐国人俘获子之，把他剁成肉酱，随后杀死燕王姬哙。","content_jianti_auto":"3燕子之为王三年，国内大乱。将军市被与太子平谋攻子之。齐王令人谓太子曰：「寡人闻太子将饬君臣之义，明父子之位，寡人之国唯太子所以令之。」太子因要党聚众，使市被攻子之，不克。市被反攻太子。搆难数月，死者数万人，百姓恫恐。齐王令章子将五都之兵，因北地之众以伐燕。燕士卒不战，城门不闭。齐人取子之，醢之，遂杀燕王哙。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":238,"number":3,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第三 (周紀三) / 赧王上 / 元年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"8c627621-db0e-11ef-9905-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-314},"tongjian_id":"8c627621-db0e-11ef-9905-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"齊桓公","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐桓公","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a375fcd5-db0e-11ef-9921-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"葵丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"葵丘","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a375fcd6-db0e-11ef-9ff0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"孟子曰：齊桓公葵丘之會，初命曰：「誅不孝，無易樹子，無以妾爲妻。」","note_content_jianti_auto":"孟子曰：齐桓公葵丘之会，初命曰：「诛不孝，无易树子，无以妾为妻。」","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"a375fcd4-db0e-11ef-a1df-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"桓","people_name_jianti_auto":"桓","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a375fcd9-db0e-11ef-acee-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"隱","people_name_jianti_auto":"隐","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"a375fcda-db0e-11ef-b130-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"隱","people_name_jianti_auto":"隐","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"a375fcdb-db0e-11ef-8cc1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"隱","people_name_jianti_auto":"隐","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"a375fcdc-db0e-11ef-b0c7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"隱","people_name_jianti_auto":"隐","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"a375fcdd-db0e-11ef-8bad-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"桓","people_name_jianti_auto":"桓","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"a375fcde-db0e-11ef-8814-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"隱","people_name_jianti_auto":"隐","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"a375fcdf-db0e-11ef-911f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"桓","people_name_jianti_auto":"桓","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"a375fce0-db0e-11ef-8547-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"惠公","people_name_jianti_auto":"惠公","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"a375fce1-db0e-11ef-8574-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孟子","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟子","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"a375fce2-db0e-11ef-afdb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孟子","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟子","start_index":107,"tongjian_id":"a375fce3-db0e-11ef-9a5b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"聲子","people_name_jianti_auto":"声子","start_index":114,"tongjian_id":"a375fce4-db0e-11ef-9f80-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"隱公","people_name_jianti_auto":"隐公","start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"a375fce5-db0e-11ef-861e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"宋武公","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋武公","start_index":121,"tongjian_id":"a375fce6-db0e-11ef-b221-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"仲子","people_name_jianti_auto":"仲子","start_index":125,"tongjian_id":"a375fce7-db0e-11ef-ba55-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魯夫人","people_name_jianti_auto":"鲁夫人","start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"a375fce8-db0e-11ef-a7d1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"桓公","people_name_jianti_auto":"桓公","start_index":134,"tongjian_id":"a375fce9-db0e-11ef-91f6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"惠公","people_name_jianti_auto":"惠公","start_index":138,"tongjian_id":"a375fcea-db0e-11ef-8f5f-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"隱公","people_name_jianti_auto":"隐公","start_index":144,"tongjian_id":"a375fceb-db0e-11ef-9442-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"春秋公羊傳曰：桓幼而貴，隱長而卑；隱長又賢，諸大夫扳隱而立之；隱之立，爲桓立也。隱長又賢，何以不宜立？立適以長不以賢，立子以貴不以長。桓何以貴？母貴也。母貴，則子何以貴？子以母貴，母以子貴。左氏傳曰：惠公元妃孟子；孟子卒，繼室以聲子，生隱公。宋武公生仲子，爲魯夫人，生桓公，而惠公薨，是以隱公立而奉之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"春秋公羊传曰：桓幼而贵，隐长而卑；隐长又贤，诸大夫扳隐而立之；隐之立，为桓立也。隐长又贤，何以不宜立？立适以长不以贤，立子以贵不以长。桓何以贵？母贵也。母贵，则子何以贵？子以母贵，母以子贵。左氏传曰：惠公元妃孟子；孟子卒，继室以声子，生隐公。宋武公生仲子，为鲁夫人，生桓公，而惠公薨，是以隐公立而奉之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"a375fcd8-db0e-11ef-87ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"魯莊公","people_name_jianti_auto":"鲁庄公","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a375fcef-db0e-11ef-90fb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"姜氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"姜氏","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"a375fcf0-db0e-11ef-8f41-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"成風","people_name_jianti_auto":"成风","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a375fcf1-db0e-11ef-9735-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"莊公","people_name_jianti_auto":"庄公","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"a375fcf2-db0e-11ef-bbdc-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"僖公","people_name_jianti_auto":"僖公","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"a375fcf3-db0e-11ef-88be-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"姜氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"姜氏","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"a375fcf4-db0e-11ef-9754-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"共仲","people_name_jianti_auto":"共仲","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"a375fcf5-db0e-11ef-adf7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"閔公","people_name_jianti_auto":"闵公","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"a375fcf6-db0e-11ef-830d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"共仲","people_name_jianti_auto":"共仲","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"a375fcf7-db0e-11ef-89ee-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"齊桓公","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐桓公","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"a375fcf8-db0e-11ef-bb7c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"僖公","people_name_jianti_auto":"僖公","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"a375fcf9-db0e-11ef-8fda-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"邾","place_name_jianti_auto":"邾","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"a375fcfa-db0e-11ef-b74a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"魯莊公夫人姜氏。成風者，莊公之妾，僖公之母也。姜氏通于共仲，弒閔公而欲立共仲，不克，遂孫于邾，齊桓公殺之。僖公旣立，請其喪，以夫人之禮葬之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"鲁庄公夫人姜氏。成风者，庄公之妾，僖公之母也。姜氏通于共仲，弑闵公而欲立共仲，不克，遂孙于邾，齐桓公杀之。僖公既立，请其丧，以夫人之礼葬之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"a375fcee-db0e-11ef-a33e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"forward_reference","source_end_index":13,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"事見後一百八卷太元二十一年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a49895bf-db0e-11ef-96de-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"事見後一百八卷太元二十一年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"事见后一百八卷太元二十一年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":109,"tongjian_id":"a375fcfb-db0e-11ef-aa36-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":10,"source_start_index":0,"source_text":"事見二卷周愼靚王五年","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c5eb45e-db0e-11ef-b22e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"周愼靚王","people_name_jianti_auto":"周愼靓王","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a375fcfd-db0e-11ef-b2f4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"事見二卷周愼靚王五年。","note_content_jianti_auto":"事见二卷周愼靓王五年。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"a375fcfc-db0e-11ef-a9c8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"魯桓公","people_name_jianti_auto":"鲁桓公","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a375fcff-db0e-11ef-b057-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"文姜","people_name_jianti_auto":"文姜","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"a375fd00-db0e-11ef-b161-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"齊襄公","people_name_jianti_auto":"齐襄公","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"a375fd01-db0e-11ef-98a4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"桓公","people_name_jianti_auto":"桓公","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"a375fd02-db0e-11ef-8b29-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"襄公","people_name_jianti_auto":"襄公","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"a375fd03-db0e-11ef-9982-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"桓公","people_name_jianti_auto":"桓公","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"a375fd04-db0e-11ef-ad72-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"莊公","people_name_jianti_auto":"庄公","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"a375fd05-db0e-11ef-b0c2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"姜氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"姜氏","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"a375fd06-db0e-11ef-8ac6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"文姜","people_name_jianti_auto":"文姜","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"a375fd07-db0e-11ef-a132-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"魯桓公之夫人曰文姜，通于齊襄公，桓公謫之。夫人以告，襄公遂殺桓公。至莊公二十一年，春秋書夫人姜氏薨；二十二年書葬我小君文姜，是不之廢也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"鲁桓公之夫人曰文姜，通于齐襄公，桓公谪之。夫人以告，襄公遂杀桓公。至庄公二十一年，春秋书夫人姜氏薨；二十二年书葬我小君文姜，是不之废也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":154,"tongjian_id":"a375fcfe-db0e-11ef-85de-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"垂","people_name_jianti_auto":"垂","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a375fd0b-db0e-11ef-a5ee-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"段氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"段氏","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"a375fd0c-db0e-11ef-9062-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"垂","people_name_jianti_auto":"垂","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"a375fd0d-db0e-11ef-8e02-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"a375fd0e-db0e-11ef-a18e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"私憾，謂譖殺垂妃段氏，又譖垂而逐之奔秦也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"私憾，谓谮杀垂妃段氏，又谮垂而逐之奔秦也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":180,"tongjian_id":"a375fd0a-db0e-11ef-9eea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-314,"link_td_description":"燕王子之，战国时曾任燕王哙的国相，后获禅让成为燕王。在位第三年时国内动荡，齐国军队趁虚而入发兵攻燕，子之被杀并剁成肉酱。","link_td_id":"Q10009038","link_td_number_id":505348,"people_name":"之","people_name_jianti_auto":"之","people_xingming":"子之","start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"a3769911-db0e-11ef-a16d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"崔鴻曰：齊桓公命諸侯無以妾爲妻。夫之於妻，猶不可以妾代之，況子而易其母乎！春秋所稱母以子貴者，君母旣沒，得以妾母爲小君也；至於享祀宗廟，則成風終不得配莊公也。君父之所爲，臣子必習而效之，猶形聲之於影響也；寶之逼殺其母，由垂爲之漸也。堯、舜之讓，猶爲之、噲之禍，況違禮而縱私者乎！昔文姜得罪於桓公，春秋不之廢。可足渾氏雖有罪於前朝，然小君之禮成矣；垂以私憾廢之，又立兄妾之無子者，皆非禮也。","content_fanyi":"崔鸿说：齐桓公命令诸侯不得把妾立为妻。丈夫对于妻子，尚且不可以用妾来取代她，何况儿子怎么能够改换自己的母亲呢！《春秋》中所说的“母以子贵”，是指国君的嫡母去世之后，妾室母亲可以被尊为小君；至于在宗庙中受祭，成风终究不能与鲁庄公配享。君主和父亲的所作所为，臣子和儿子必定会学习并效仿，就如同形体与影子、声音与回响的关系；慕容宝威逼杀害他的母亲，正是由慕容垂的作为逐渐影响所致。像尧、舜那样的禅让，尚且还出现了子之、燕王哙那样的祸乱，何况是违背礼制、放纵私情的人呢！从前文姜得罪了鲁桓公，《春秋》后来也没有因此废黜她。可足浑氏虽然在前朝有罪，但她作为皇后的礼制名分已经确立；慕容垂因为私人怨恨废黜了她，又立兄长姬妾中没有儿子的人为皇太后，这些都是不合礼法的。","content_jianti_auto":"崔鸿曰：齐桓公命诸侯无以妾为妻。夫之于妻，犹不可以妾代之，况子而易其母乎！春秋所称母以子贵者，君母既没，得以妾母为小君也；至于享祀宗庙，则成风终不得配庄公也。君父之所为，臣子必习而效之，犹形声之于影响也；宝之逼杀其母，由垂为之渐也。尧、舜之让，犹为之、哙之祸，况违礼而纵私者乎！昔文姜得罪于桓公，春秋不之废。可足浑氏虽有罪于前朝，然小君之礼成矣；垂以私憾废之，又立兄妾之无子者，皆非礼也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":9399,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第一百六 (晉紀二十八) / 烈宗孝武皇帝中之上 / 十一年 / 第 14 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"a375fcd3-db0e-11ef-b62f-a0d3651f611f","year_int":386},"tongjian_id":"a375fcd3-db0e-11ef-b62f-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3}],"page_size":7,"total_pages":1,"total_paragraphs":3},"profile":{"alias_list":["燕王子之"],"biography":"燕王子之，战国时曾任燕王哙的国相，后获禅让成为燕王。在位第三年时国内动荡，齐国军队趁虚而入发兵攻燕，子之被杀并剁成肉酱。","death_year":-314,"link_td_id":"Q10009038","name":"子之","number_id":505348},"relationships":[{"direction":"reverse","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"禅让君位，来源文本：听信鹿毛寿之言禅让君位于宰相子之","relation_property_id":"P100061","relation_property_label":"其他关系","source_person_id":"Q10000559","source_person_name":"燕王哙","source_person_number_id":316085,"statement_id":"S-Q10000559-P100061-Q10009038","target_person_id":"Q10009038","target_person_name":"子之","target_person_number_id":505348},{"direction":"reverse","rank":"normal","relation_detail":"反对其篡位，来源文本：因起兵反對篡位的宰相子之","relation_property_id":"P100061","relation_property_label":"其他关系","source_person_id":"Q10002452","source_person_name":"太子平","source_person_number_id":961238,"statement_id":"S-Q10002452-P100061-Q10009038","target_person_id":"Q10009038","target_person_name":"子之","target_person_number_id":505348}]},"message":"success","success":true}